        "TileImage": "$($repository c87de1d6-ef5c-44de-8c97-421b609b1633).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47, \r\rParisi’s network is proving larger than we anticipated. In Bangkok, Ronald Sump, Parisi´s closest friend, has been attempting to secure Parisi’s remaining assets. Hotel waitress Yada Pimolkittikool may have witnessed meetings connected to him. Meanwhile, brothers Lukas and Anakiné Himmeltramp are investors in the restaurant where Parisi worked. Four people, one connection. Eliminate them, and we may finally uncover what Parisi left behind.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
